# Node tarball chain (no primary pin): `nvm install` verifies the nodejs.org
# dist tarball's SHA-256 against the SHASUMS256.txt nvm fetches over HTTPS
# from nodejs.org (TLS trust of nodejs.org) and fails closed on a mismatch,
# deleting the tarball before the install can proceed.
NPM_VERSION="12.2.2"
